# ---------------------------------------------------------------- people
@char q.ned
name: Ned Furrowe, district inspector
speaker: NED
faction: district
about: Abel's son. Signs the district's returns. Keeps the true figures in pencil on his maps and has never shown them to anyone.

@char q.mary
name: Mary Furrowe
speaker: MARY
faction: district
about: Ned's wife. Feeds everyone first and herself last, and says so.

@char q.pell
name: Pell Furrowe
speaker: PELL
faction: district
about: Twelve. Repeats what his teacher said.

@char q.abel
name: Abel Furrowe
speaker: ABEL
faction: district
about: Ned's father, once the exchange inspector. Still has the good hat.

@char q.mott
name: Walter Mott, brigade clerk
speaker: MOTT
faction: district
about: Clerk for Krall's End and the Haldane barns. Writes his sevens without a bar.

@char q.pask
name: Commissioner Pask
speaker: PASK
faction: directorate
about: The Directorate's man for the district. Came from Arlen in October with a list of figures already in it.

@char q.krall
name: Jonah Krall, chairman of Krall's End
speaker: KRALL
faction: chairmen
about: Stood up in the meeting and gave the biggest figure on the plain. Wants to be district chairman by spring.

@char q.will
name: Sergeant Will Brack
speaker: WILL
faction: district
about: Militia sergeant for the cells and the road post. Thirty-six. Drinks what the post takes off carts.

@char q.edie
name: Edie Brack
speaker: EDIE
faction: millstreet
about: Will's wife. Takes in mending. Wears her sleeves down.

@char q.davey
name: Davey Brack
speaker: DAVEY
faction: millstreet
about: Nine. Copies his father.

@char q.gedge
name: Constable Gedge
speaker: GEDGE
faction: district
about: Will's constable. His father lost the Orme mill's carting to Hesh hands at two-thirds the rate, and drank the rest of his life on it.

@char q.tesk
name: Old Tesk
speaker: TESK
faction: hesh
about: A Hesh herder from the hill above Krall's End, in the cells since Tuesday for his goats' oats.

@char q.captain
name: Captain Holt, the requisition captain
speaker: HOLT
faction: directorate
about: Commands the requisition squads. Has a quota of his own, from Arlen, for sacks taken.

@char q.tomas
name: Tomas Haldane
speaker: TOMAS
faction: hesh
about: Eleven, half-Hesh, a braid and a blue thread at the wrist. Wears the Orme lad's brown coat, his own having gone on the cart in October.

@char q.anni
name: Anni Haldane
speaker: ANNI
faction: hesh
about: Fourteen. Counts things out loud.

@char q.aaron
name: Aaron Haldane
speaker: AARON
faction: hesh
about: Nine. Walks at the horse's head when the cart goes out; his mother drives. Says nothing to anyone in uniform.

@char q.bet
name: Bet Haldane
speaker: BET
faction: hesh
about: Tomas's mother, a Tarn cottar's daughter who married a Hesh hand. Thirty-five, and looks older.

@char q.ilo
name: Ilo Haldane
speaker: ILO
faction: hesh
about: Tomas's father. Came down from the hills to work Abel Furrowe's harvests and was given his surname by the census.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- the record
@var q_class
default: none
values: none, inspector, militia
@var q_figure
default: none
values: none, true, inflated, blamed
@var q_cart
default: none
values: none, taken, through, arrested
@var q_door
default: none
values: none, talked, held, broken, aside

@fact q.true_in_hand
about: The true figure, in your own hand.
by: the day
@fact q.tomas_held
about: Tomas Haldane is in the cells.
by: the day
@fact q.pencil_kept
@fact q.pencil_rubbed
@fact q.promised_hill
@fact q.hill_seen
@fact q.tomas_sent
@fact q.log_true
@fact q.log_two
@fact q.cart_counted
@fact q.read_aloud
@fact q.tesk_let
@fact q.end
@fact q.will_down
about: Will Brack went down under the granary door.
by: the day

@char q.lil
name: Lil, Mary Furrowe's sister
speaker: LIL
faction: district
about: From Tarn Hollow, the next village over. A widow with one boy.

