@char q.daughter
name: Anni's daughter
speaker: DAUGHTER
faction: hesh
about: Twelve, years after the winter. Found the tin. Her name is for the author.

@char q.sister
name: Sister Agnes, the Furrow Church's home
speaker: SISTER
faction: district
about: Keeps the gate of the children's home on Tilney Road. Feeds them once a day and takes the thread off at the door.

@char q.lind
name: Dr Clara Lind
speaker: LIND
faction: district
about: The district's doctor for the cells and the fever. Writes nothing that isn't so.

@char q.dorrah
name: Dorrah Tesk
speaker: DORRAH
faction: hesh
about: Old Tesk's wife, on the hill above Krall's End. Has six town children in her hut that are not hers.

@char q.fenn
name: Corporal Fenn
speaker: FENN
faction: directorate
about: One of Holt's corporals at the granary. Nineteen, from Tilney. Does what he is told and then says sorry to the wrong person.

@char q.iris
name: Iris Krall
speaker: IRIS
faction: chairmen
about: Jonah Krall's wife. Knows everything said at the pump by noon.

@fact q.anni_sent
about: Anni Haldane went in at the gate on Tilney Road.
by: Bet Haldane
@fact q.aaron_taken
about: Aaron Haldane was taken from Haldane Yard.
by: Constable Gedge
@fact q.ilo_mark
about: Ilo Haldane made his mark on Holt's statement.
by: Ilo Haldane
@fact q.dorrah_taken
about: The squad took Dorrah Tesk off the hill.
by: Captain Holt
@fact q.cart_stripped
@fact q.ned_claimed
@fact q.ned_parentage
@fact q.will_bread
@fact q.looked_in
@fact q.corner_known
@fact q.tesk_sent

@char q.rose
name: Rose Brack
speaker: ROSE
faction: millstreet
about: Six. Eats out of her mother's bowl on her knee.

@var water_carried
default: 0
